{'symbol': 'CVS', 'date': '2023-05-16 10:00:00', 'title': 'VIRGINIA COMMUNITY HEALTH CENTERS AND AETNA BETTER HEALTH VIRGINIA TEAM-UP TO IMPROVE CANCER OUTCOMES IN UNDER-RESOURCED COMMUNITIES', 'text': 'RICHMOND, VA. , MAY 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AETNA BETTER HEALTH OF VIRGINIA, A CVS HEALTH COMPANY (NYSE: CVS), AND VIRGINIA COMMUNITY HEALTHCARE ASSOCIATION (VCHA) ANNOUNCED THAT AETNA PROVIDED A TOTAL OF $7.3 MILLION IN VALUE-BASED CARE INCENTIVE PAYMENTS TO 22 FEDERALLY QUALIFIED HEALTH CENTERS, ALSO KNOWN AS COMMUNITY HEALTH CENTERS, IN VIRGINIA.'}